  unitName: Blazing Emperor Adel
  unitId: 10737
  unitNumber: 1583
  description: According to one school of thought, Mildran had sufficient power to
    unify Ishgria by force at the time of Adel's reign. Many feel that Mildran could
    have temporarily put an end to the war in Ishgria even without the alliance.
    However, sustained rule over demons requires both power and terror, given their
    war-hungry natures. Had he aspired to absolute power and crushed the rebellions
    against his rule, Adel might have shifted the course of Ishgria's history.
  summonDesc: A dream beyond the last...<br>Is this a good dream, then?<br>Or is
    this a nightmare?
  fusionDesc: In all of Ishgria, I am absolute!<br>I will annihilate all who oppose
    me!
  evoDesc: I've finally achieved my own ideal... Now I must continue fighting in
    order to hold onto it!
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
